'''NRG''' (previously known as ''NRG Esports'') is an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization, formed after co-owners of the NBA's [[wikipedia:Sacramento Kings|Sacramento Kings]] purchased the LCS spot of [[Team Coast]]'s ''[[wikipedia:League of Legends|League of Legends]]'' team. They currently have teams in ''[[Rocketleague:NRG Esports|Rocket League]]'', ''[[apexlegends:NRG Esports|Apex Legends]]'', ''[[fortnite:NRG Esports|Fortnite]]'', and manage the [[overwatch:San Francisco Shock|San Francisco Shock]] in the [[overwatch:Overwatch League|Overwatch League]].

